  m_text: Liberalism is an alignment centered on individual liberty and the rule
    of law. It posits that the primary purpose of society is to protect the freedom
    of the individual from both the state and the "tyranny of the majority." This
    alignment typically supports free markets, freedom of speech, and private property,
    favoring a system where people are free to pursue their own version of "the good
    life" without interference.
