      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The Green alignment prioritizes ecological health and environmental sustainability
    above all else. It is rooted in the belief that human systems (economy, law,
    and urban planning) must operate within the physical limits of the planet. While
    often associated with the "Left," Green thought can be radical (demanding immediate
    overhaul of industry) or conservative (preserving the land for future generations).
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
